[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/talk/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n0_walter"
text = "# DRAFT
# Walter the pardoner at the Cross Keys, night 0, selling relics to the drinkers out of a rattling box.
# He knows the abbey's gate well and won't say why. (He supplies the henbane. Nothing here says so.)
== start
(A plump man in a wine-red cloak, the only colour in the room. The box on his knees rattles when he moves.)
Walter: A brother! Come and sit by Walter. Walter has something for every soul in the Keys, and you've a soul, I'll be bound.
-> topics

== again
Walter: Back to Walter! They always come back.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n0_walter_box] (Look in his box.) -> box
* [if not n0_walter_abbey] Do you know the abbey? -> abbey
* [if n0_walter_abbey] [if not n0_walter_why] What business have you at the abbey gate? -> why

== box [set n0_walter_box]
(He lifts the lid. Little bones, scraps of cloth and a cloudy phial, each on its own bed of wool.)
Walter: A tooth of Saint Apollonia, for the toothache. A thread of Our Lady's veil.
Walter: And this, a drop of her milk, from Walsingham. A groat to you, since you're in the trade.
-> buy

== buy
* I have no money. -> nocoin
* Those aren't holy. [trust walter -5] -> doubt
* (Shake your head.) -> topics

== nocoin [set n0_walter_nocoin]
Walter: No money! Of course. Your vows. Walter forgets.
(He shuts the lid gently, as if on something sleeping.)
Walter: Keep Walter in your prayers, then, and keep a kind eye on him at your gate. We'll call it square.
-> topics

== doubt
Walter: Holy enough for Aldgate.
(He is still smiling.)
Walter: Faith does the rest, brother. Faith always does.
-> topics

== abbey [set n0_walter_abbey]
Walter: Know it? I know every gate in London, and that one best of all.
Walter: You'll be the new porter. Don't look so struck, brother. Word gets about, in the trade.
Walter: You and I will be friends. I'm at that gate more nights than not.
-> topics

== why [set n0_walter_why]
Walter: Oh, this and that. Things the brothers can't grow in their own garden.
Walter: Holy business, brother. Nothing a porter need trouble his head over.
(He pats the box. Something inside it rattles.)
-> topics

== leave
Walter: Walter will see you at the gate, brother!
"
